  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPZ3cwaHlfV29WV2pva2otenRDOGhoajBmYkV6cFJjSVpMUm9lYUI0Ujd0ZTV0TkNCeDVZd1ZMZTJXaXo5ZVBOSWRnWWVqZFlGbDFTWThFSUtrX1ZSZ2gyTXpmUGgyZUJiTEt1a0FNcTJ6UV9vRFdtbTFKaXl4amdLVmg0WmdQWWsyZUZwa041Y051S0tZUFV3UmF0ZTNtUE95MWFSRGlsRjB6U08xUXpMaU0zbG1GQTg2WVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Liquid Network hack: Whitehats return 3,400 BTC</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/08/copper-ceo-amar-kuchinad-departs-as-search-for-a-buyer-enters-a-fourth-month\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Copper CEO Amar Kuchinad departs as search for a buyer enters a fourth month</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-09-09-first-staked-etf-tied-to-tron-hits-the-us-markets-wednesday-413935\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">First staked ETF tied to Tron hits the US markets on Wednesday</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
